  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">New Coop Agreement Government of the Republic of theMarshall Islands(GRMI) Natl Security Project FY23 PKO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will assist the Government of the Republic of theMarshall Islands(GRMI) to put in place requisite national security structures, systems, processes, and procedures so as to institutionalize them, resulting in sustainability beyond the life of this project.</narrative>
  </description>
